          "text": "Description: On October 22, 1980, at 6:15 PM, an individual observed from their home a series of bright lights in the sky. These lights moved quickly and appeared white or red. The observation lasted approximately 4 minutes. No other testimony regarding this phenomenon was collected, for which we have limited information.",
